{"unit_id":"qikairo7__dsh-gemini-pool#card-zh","repo":"qikairo7/dsh-gemini-pool","commit":"7f41134c1bf9ce1dcfcb9bd953adadf413cf39b4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gemini-pool（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：把 Google Antigravity / Cloud Code Assist 中的 Gemini 模型接入 DSH，并通过账号池提供统一的模型访问。它注册模型适配器、Web 设置面板、对话命令和图像工具。主要功能包括多账号额度调度与故障冷却、文本模型的图片描述旁路、按提示生成并保存图片，以及账号额度和诊断信息查看。适合已有 Google 账号、希望在 DSH 编程会话中使用 Gemini 和图像能力的用户；需通过 OAuth 授权 Google 账号，不需单独填写 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:3448","lib/pool.js:27","lib/client.js:1920"]}
{"unit_id":"qikairo7__dsh-gemini-pool#card-en","repo":"qikairo7/dsh-gemini-pool","commit":"7f41134c1bf9ce1dcfcb9bd953adadf413cf39b4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-gemini-pool connects Gemini through Google Antigravity to DSH as a Web model provider. It adds account-pool scheduling, quota recovery, image descriptions for text-only models, image generation, and account settings. Users authorize a Google account with OAuth; no separate API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:3448","lib/pool.js:27","lib/client.js:1920"]}
