{"unit_id":"qikairo7__dsh-gemini-pool#feature-1","repo":"qikairo7/dsh-gemini-pool","commit":"7f41134c1bf9ce1dcfcb9bd953adadf413cf39b4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gemini-pool 的功能「Gemini 模型接入」：在 DSH 注册 Antigravity 模型适配器，通过账号池发送模型请求。用户完成 Google OAuth 后即可在 DSH 选择该提供商的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:3448","lib/index.js:3455"]}
{"unit_id":"qikairo7__dsh-gemini-pool#feature-2","repo":"qikairo7/dsh-gemini-pool","commit":"7f41134c1bf9ce1dcfcb9bd953adadf413cf39b4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gemini-pool 的功能「账号池调度」：将多个 Google 账号纳入池中，按可用额度和调度设置分配请求；账号遇到失败会进入冷却，后台探测可恢复账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/pool.js:27","lib/index.js:3484"]}
{"unit_id":"qikairo7__dsh-gemini-pool#feature-3","repo":"qikairo7/dsh-gemini-pool","commit":"7f41134c1bf9ce1dcfcb9bd953adadf413cf39b4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gemini-pool 的功能「图片理解旁路」：当当前主模型不支持图像输入时，agent/pre-step 桥接器可调用池内 Gemini 将新输入图片改写为文字描述，再交给主模型处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/vision-bridge.js:162","lib/index.js:3534"]}
{"unit_id":"qikairo7__dsh-gemini-pool#feature-4","repo":"qikairo7/dsh-gemini-pool","commit":"7f41134c1bf9ce1dcfcb9bd953adadf413cf39b4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gemini-pool 的功能「图片生成」：模型可调用 antigravity_image_generate 并提交提示词，可选文件名和输出目录；生成的图片保存到工作区并返回相对路径及 Markdown 引用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/image-tool.js:25","lib/image-tool.js:67","lib/image-tool.js:99"]}
{"unit_id":"qikairo7__dsh-gemini-pool#feature-5","repo":"qikairo7/dsh-gemini-pool","commit":"7f41134c1bf9ce1dcfcb9bd953adadf413cf39b4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gemini-pool 的功能「看图工具」：调用 antigravity_read_image，可传图片附件哈希、工作区文件、data URL 或图片网址，并可附问题；工具返回池内 Gemini 生成的图片文字描述。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/vision-tool.js:248","lib/vision-tool.js:291"]}
